  "inputs": {
   "value": "1933 rubber-hose cartoon animation in the style of a modern mockumentary, confident black ink outlines, soft halftone shading, warm sepia and cream on aged newsprint, handheld documentary camera with a slight drift. A lanky cartoon man with long wavy shoulder-length brown hair and a full bushy handlebar moustache, in a dark v-neck t-shirt."
  },
  "_meta": {
   "title": "\u25b6 LOOK"
  }
 },
 "9": {
  "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
  "inputs": {
   "value": "Shot 1, three seconds. A family living room at night. The camera is beside the television, at seated height, looking back across the room at the man on the sofa; the television is out of frame and its light flickers on his face. He is mid-bite of a crisp. A woman (S2) says from off-screen, exasperated: <d>[English] Seth. It is in German. Again.</d> He stops chewing. He does not look into the lens."
  },
  "_meta": {
   "title": "\u25b6 SHOT 1"
  }
 },
 "10": {
  "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
  "inputs": {
   "value": "Cut. Shot 2, two and a half seconds, closer, still beside the television. One thing happens: he raises both hands in a helpless shrug, palms open, eyebrows high, and holds it. He does not look into the lens."
  },
  "_meta": {
   "title": "\u25b6 SHOT 2"
  }
 },
 "11": {
  "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
  "inputs": {
   "value": "Cut. Shot 3, two and a half seconds, the same closer angle. Nobody speaks. His hands come slowly down. His face settles into a flat, cornered stare directed just past the camera, and holds there. He does not look into the lens."
  },
  "_meta": {
   "title": "\u25b6 SHOT 3"
  }
 },
 "12": {
  "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
  "inputs": {
   "value": "Cut. Shot 4, four seconds. A talking-head confessional: he sits alone against a plain wall in even flat light, framed centre, and looks straight down the barrel of the lens directly into the camera. He holds the look for a moment, entirely deadpan, then gives one small shrug. He (S1) says, flatly, straight to camera: <d>[English] That is Wilson's department.</d>"
  },
  "_meta": {
   "title": "\u25b6 SHOT 4"
  }
 },
 "13": {
  "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
  "inputs": {
   "value": "Overall soundscape: a muffled television in another language, a room tone, one crisp packet rustle. Non-diegetic music: none."
